+## Cocos Creator routing
+
+For Creator 3.x load cocos-creator-core. Read creator.version in package.json and
+confirm the selected editor. Legacy project.json needs corroborating Creator files;
+plain TypeScript and Cocos2d-x do not select this 3.x skill. Bind genre engine slots
+to Creator APIs. Artwork requests select cocos-creator-core + create-game-assets,
+then the core skill's art-import reference. For example, “制作 Cocos 像素角色和 UI”
+selects those two skills. Preserve 2.x projects and consult matching documentation.
